WEBVTT

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.610
Give me a status report!

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:18.370
Ships from Le Garite and De Metrio are exchanging fire.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.290
One of De Metrio's ships has lost control and is falling into our atmosphere.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.790
It's coming down near this ship.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.230
That's...!

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.610
A De Metrio ship?

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.190
What happened?

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.280
It was attacked!

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:56.280
Hey!

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.920
Ships that have lost their subspace fields can go ahead and break formation!

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:12.380
Tell them to avoid returning fire as much as possible!

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.170
Any response from Le Garite?

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:18.220
We're trying all channels, but they continue to maintain silence.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:22.180
What's the meaning of this, Dizelmine?!

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:25.890
How could I even think of breaking my vow

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:28.310
and cease pursuit of my own path?

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:33.730
I had already decided that day to defeat him, and return the Polyhedron to its rightful form.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.780
I will now fulfill my duty as king.

