00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:13.500
Betrayal over the Skies of Kamogawa

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.500
<i>Again, we repeat:</i>

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.630
<i>The government has just announced that hostilities have broken out</i>

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:17.880
<i>between De Metrio and Le Garite forces in orbit above Earth.</i>

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:22.470
<i>As a result of this fighting, a De Metrio ship has crash-landed on Earth.</i>

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.470
<i>Authorities are investigating the extent of the damage.</i>

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:29.230
<i>The government has called an emergency session</i>

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.640
<i>to seek immediate answers</i>

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.520
<i>from both De Metrio and Le Garite...</i>

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.530
What do you think is going to happen now?

