00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.830
Are you okay?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.290
Yes, I'm aboard Pharos.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.580
Huh?! Right now?!

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:54.500
I see. Understood.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:56.380
Effective immediately,

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.500
route all communications through here.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.170
We received a communiqué

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.380
from De Metrio's trade representative.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.090
What did they say?

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:08.970
Apparently, Le Garite has commenced simultaneous attacks throughout the entire Polyhedron.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:15.020
<i>What are you trying to do, Dizelmine?</i>

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.620
You're going in Orca, aren't you?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.620
I'm going to find out what happened.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.170
If this is something your brother started...

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.750
We don't know that for sure, yet.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.800
But if it is?

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.510
I don't know.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.140
But if he did...

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.810
We'll have to find out for sure, won't we?

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.350
Muginami...

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.440
After that, we'll just wing it.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:05.030
Lan, it's too risky going alone, so I'll go with you.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.370
What took you two so long!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.250
Madoka?!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:29.010
Are you planning to head for Dizelmine's ship alone?!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.890
Don't look at me like that.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.140
You'll get wrinkles.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.640
Just kidding.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:41.570
At this rate, the entire Polyhedron will become embroiled in conflict.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:47.400
I need to ask Dizelmine himself if that's his true intention.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:48.030
With all due respect...!

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.990
You'll be in charge of the fleet until I return.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.160
Lord Villagiulio...

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:56.750
Stop giving me that look.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.670
I'll be right back.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.000
De Metrio Lu Villagiulio...

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.300
Let's go, Arvirium!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.810
A single Ovid has left the De Metrio flagship.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.270
It's headed this way.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.600
It's Villagiulio.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.310
How predictable can that man get?

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.230
Your orders?

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.030
I will deal with him myself.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.490
It's a courtesy I extend as king.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:30.820
Understood.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.990
King Dizelmine will be leaving.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.620
Prepare Magoltul for launch!

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:39.330
Yes, sir! Preparing Magoltul for launch!

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.550
Dizelmine!

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.530
Not even a warning?

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.530
Some greeting!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:18.290
Simply telling you wouldn't have convinced you, right?

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:31.510
Were you two going to leave me behind like the last time?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:34.600
No, that wasn't our intention...

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:37.430
But this is between Le Garite and De Metrio...

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.770
That's where you're wrong!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.190
Lan, you don't get it at all!

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.900
You and Muginami are my comrades!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:49.690
Your problems are my problems!

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.820
If you're sad, I'm sad.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.450
If you're happy, then I'm happy, too!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.040
Does that make me sound creepy to you?

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.160
No, we never said that.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:06.790
Besides, the three of us together vowed never to use our Vox for battle.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.590
If we're going to break that vow,

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.630
the three of us have to break it together!

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:14.220
Madoka's right.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:15.640
Muginami...

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:20.850
If the two of you were in trouble, I'd do the same thing!

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.850
Wouldn't you do the same, Lan?

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:26.310
Woof!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.040
Big Sis?!

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.330
You're going to fly, aren't you?

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:48.500
Yeah.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.340
I see...

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.210
Dad!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:55.680
Hey.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.050
Uncle Hiroshi?

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.260
He insisted on coming.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:07.100
I packed you lunches, in case you get hungry.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.020
Uncle...

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.730
I told him this wasn't a picnic, but...

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.570
Thank you, Boss.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.070
Thank you very much.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.360
Thank you, Uncle Hiroshi.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:22.370
The three of you are the pretty faces that bring business to my shop.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.910
Don't go getting yourselves hurt, now.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:29.670
Come back safely, so I can see your happy faces again.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:30.920
Got that?

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:31.960
Yeah.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:33.260
Yes.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.010
We'll be going, then.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:39.510
Okay! Now go get 'em, girls!

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.940
Let's go, Midori!

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.730
Orca, let's fly together once more.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:52.820
I'm counting on you, Hupo.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:14.760
Dizelmine!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:18.220
Are you serious about starting a war?!

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.890
That's a stupid question.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:21.640
<i>What?!</i>

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:28.390
Have I ever, even for a moment, stopped fighting to protect <i>the Polyhedron?</i>

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.690
<i>Lord Villagiulio! We're sending support immediately!</i>

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:31.440
Cancel that order!

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.400
<i>Roger!</i>

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.940
<i>We'll...what?!</i>

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:39.150
As long as he's saying that he's doing this for the sake of Polyhedron...

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.910
Then I must trust him, more than anyone!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.080
Regardless of how badly I want to kill this bastard!

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:50.420
Lord Villagiulio...

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:51.960
Lady Grania!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:52.920
What is it?!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:55.250
A ship is emerging from warp up ahead!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.340
More enemy ships?!

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:10.770
Why are you being so shy right now?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.900
Quit hiding and show yourself!

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:18.030
<i>Come on, I'm willing to listen to what you want to do with the Polyhedron, just like old times!</i>

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.200
Damn!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.790
<i>You owe me one.</i>

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:28.540
That you, Izo?!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.080
Great, who is it this time?

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.010
That's some pretty sorry flying for the king of De Metrio.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:44.260
Lax Lestorine Ha Kirius, here to assist in the name of honor.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.010
What're you guys doing?

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.140
Who asked for your help?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:50.390
<i>Don't get the wrong idea.</i>

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:53.480
I'm only here to protect Kamogawa.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.440
<i>Kamogawa?!</i>

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.980
I don't want this ocean to meet the same fate as De Metrio.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.240
What a coincidence.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.700
Same as us.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.320
We knew a battle had begun

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.530
when we first came out of warp.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.830
That's when Kirius said we were heading back to Earth.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.000
<i>He started threatening</i>

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.120
<i>the captain of the spaceship to turn back.</i>

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.540
I didn't threaten him, I convinced him.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:15.460
<i>Right...</i>

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:19.250
<i>You "convinced" him by sticking a sword to his throat.</i>

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.210
<i>Relax.</i>

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:23.970
We won't get in the way of any direct talks

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.340
between you two monarchs.

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:26.800
Let's go!

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.060
We won't allow anyone to destroy Kamogawa!

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:36.650
Feel the power of my swordsmanship

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:37.770
polished by the wild seas!

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:44.820
<i>What's your next move, Dizelmine?</i>

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.320
<i>It's just the two of us now.</i>

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.160
<i>What do you say, let's be honest with each other?</i>

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.960
<i>Luckily, Moid's not here.</i>

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.210
Moid? What are you talking about?

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.790
Don't try to hide it.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.130
We have intel.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.340
What's he been telling you this time-?

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.260
<i>Are you insinuating that he made me do this?</i>

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:04.840
Dizel...

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.720
It was all my own decision!

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:08.850
Me! The King of Le Garite!

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.160
A mode change?!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:39.630
I'm getting a Vox reading that's not in our database!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:40.590
What?!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.550
Are you sure it's not a sensor error?

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:43.710
No, I'm positive!

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:49.930
Are you saying there's another Vox aside from Yurikano's Core?

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:57.100
Do you realize what you've done?!

00:13:57.440 --> 00:14:01.900
Do you really want to control this world so badly?!

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.780
I listened to your plan to achieve peace through talks.

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:09.660
Not just once, but twice.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:14.120
But to me, your vision of the future holds nothing but flaws,

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:16.370
<i>and will end in failure.</i>

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.620
What's needed is power!

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.250
You intend to create the world by yourself?!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.710
You need to listen to other opinions—

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:26.630
I have no need of other opinions!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.680
Especially not from the likes of you, who's only interested in personal gain!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.580
Big Brother! Are you all right?!

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.490
Yeah...

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:00.500
Of course, nothing I say will convince you, when I look like this.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.750
Madoka...

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:05.750
Laffinty...

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.050
<i>Hold on, this is between me and...</i>

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.220
No, Big Brother.

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.560
<i>This is also our problem now.</i>

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.230
Brother, please stop this.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:24.940
Laffinty...

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.230
It's not like you to do things this way!

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.490
<i>You love peace more than anyone.</i>

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.070
<i>More than anyone,</i>

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:38.200
<i>you wished happiness for the people of Le Garite and the Polyhedron!</i>

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.210
Remember, life is a miracle!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.750
Don't act like you know me!

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.210
You damn...idiot!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:56.050
The enemy Vox has crash-landed on Maebara Beach.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.600
She went for an axe kick right off the bat...

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.890
That was a roundhouse kick to the head.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:03.350
An <i>enzuigiri...</i>

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:08.400
Vox particle readings are increasing.

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.420
You have the nerve to attack your own sister?!

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:34.380
Why? What's going on?

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.260
Why is this happening?!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:39.060
I thought you'd made up with Big Brother Giuvi!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.890
I thought you'd vowed to work together!

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.520
Answer me, Lan's brother!

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:46.190
Dizelmine!

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.860
I wasn't the one who betrayed the other first...

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.990
He was.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.200
Huh?

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.450
Dizelmine...

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:01.580
He sided with them...

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.870
The people I despise more than anyone!

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:09.210
The ones who tried to destroy the peace of the Polyhedron,

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.840
by defying me with force!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:14.170
Wait a minute!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.510
That was a long time ago—!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.550
Why did you do it, Villagiulio?!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.140
Why?!

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.350
You, of all people, should have known!

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:25.810
The many sacrifices our ancestors had to make

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:29.310
to build the peace and stability that we have today!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.150
Brother?

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:42.580
That life is a miracle in itself!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:44.370
Dizelmine?!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:14.570
What the—?!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.990
Get me a damage report immediately!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.280
What happened to Madoka and the others?

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:21.830
We're checking on them now.

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:24.080
No...

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.870
The Circle of Rin-ne...

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.670
<i>"Feeding off a tainted heart..."</i>

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.790
Oww!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.640
Brother?

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:33.400
Big...Brother?

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:43.410
<i>Screw the Polyhedron.</i>

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:49.250
At this point, all I care about is killing you!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.220
Big...Brother...

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.310
<i>Big Brother!</i>

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:22.610
Research institutes around the world are reporting changes in quantum particle levels!

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:24.700
What's starting to happen?

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.530
The same thing that happened 20,000 years ago.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.370
If this continues, Earth...

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.830
No, the entire universe will be...

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:43.590
This is terrible.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:46.470
Beyond terrible.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:49.510
If you plan on doing anything more...

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.230
We will not forgive you!

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.160
Look out!

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.540
Let's go, Lan! Muginami!

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:20.920
The demon has risen!

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:32.020
Huh?

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:32.810
What?!

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.640
Madoka! Lan?!

